  "is_null_result": true,
  "conclusion": "PRACTICALLY NULL: Weekly meta-labeling marginally better than daily (XGBoost AUC 0.558 vs K538 0.48-0.52) but NOT tradeable. All ML strategies underperform pure VT (Sharpe 0.53-0.60 vs VT 0.90) and even simple VIX>20 rule (0.69). Feature correlations 4x stronger than daily (max |r|=0.084 vs <0.02) but still too weak. Regime analysis reveals VT NEVER outperforms B&H in any VIX regime on a weekly basis (win rate 37-44%, negative excess in all regimes). The ~4%/yr VT insurance premium is a long-run statistical property, not predictable at weekly horizons. XGBoost AUC 0.675 in 2020-2021 (COVID) but 0.44 in 2022-2023 — signal is regime-dependent and not robust.",
